WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:12.810
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.580
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:22.050
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.820
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.490
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:36.470
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:45.350
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:56.500
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:00.700
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.360
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:11.480
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:20.380
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:38.970
DEMON ALRON
THE TERRIFYING DRESS

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:51.580
You're so beautiful, my lady!

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:54.980
Are you flattering me again?

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.940
Not at all.

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:00.590
You become more and more
beautiful every time I see you.

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:04.550
When I embrace you this way,

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:07.330
I experience true happiness.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.660
But...

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:12.260
But what, Alron?

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:17.140
You are beautiful, but sorrow
overshadows your face of late.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.570
What are you saying?

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:23.710
I am the Demon Marshal Lacock!
Nothing troubles me!

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:26.620
No, you must not hide it.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:31.580
The one casting that shadow
on your head is Devilman!

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:38.190
I loathe Devilman! He's the one
who pains my lady!

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:42.160
I shall go to human world...

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:45.330
And crush Devilman
and his land together!

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:48.070
- Do not stop me, my lady.
- Alron!

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:53.800
Your devoted Alron goes
forth to fight for you!

00:02:58.010 --> 00:02:59.990
Alron! Alron!

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.430
Yo!

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:22.130
Bunch of weirdos.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.510
What's this?

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:36.050
"I feel bad, Alphonne tortures
you with all these tests"

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:39.950
When you finish this letter,
come to the greenhouse.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.880
Your beauty wishes to give you a kiss.

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:47.220
I'm sure you'll like it.
Signed, your beloved Lala.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:49.200
For crying out loud!

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:51.430
Huh?

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.430
- I'm first!
- No, I am!

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:57.870
Shut up! I'm better looking than you are!

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:00.740
- I'm first!
- I'm first!

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.240
Oh my!

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:05.580
No! Keep off me!

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:07.940
Woah!

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:10.380
Hold on, where's Akira?

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:12.380
Who cares about Fudo?

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:14.790
Hurry up, and lay one on me!

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:19.060
Aw, shoot! I forgot to put
a name on my letter!

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:23.330
Stupid! Why would you write
the same letter ten times?

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:27.360
I couldn't remember which seat was yours.

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:31.140
I thought I'd spread them around
so you'd be sure to find one.

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:33.640
That's exactly why I call you stupid!

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:38.140
Yeah, I am stupid.
Is that bad?

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:39.540
Of course it is!

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:42.780
But some humans find it endearing.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:46.110
- Well?
- Honestly...

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:49.560
They're just making fun of you!
Humans are rude like that.

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:55.960
What should I do?
How can I cure my stupidity?

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:57.490
How should I know?

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:05.030
Tell me! Tell me!

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.240
DIE!

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:16.780
The humans have a saying,
“Only death will cure a fool“

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:20.550
That's right!
My only choice is to die!

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.790
It's so simple!

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:26.090
She just doesn't get it...

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.190
- I'll go die now!
- Hey, hold on!

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:32.860
How dusty!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:49.620
Oh my! I can't even die properly!

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:54.060
Someone from the Demon Tribe
won't die that easily!

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:07.500
Hey, want a lift?

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.010
Come on, I'll drive ya!

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:17.520
Thank you, but I'm fine.
I am in a hurry.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.290
That's why I'm offering you a lift!

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:23.520
Come on, it's all right.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.760
Look! Here, too!

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:37.390
G-G-Ghost!

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:39.240
Help me!

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.140
I can't breathe...

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:50.580
Boy, come over here!

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:01.090
Hey, is that an accident?
Let's take a look.

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:09.090
Akira's so nosy!

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:10.830
I'll check it out too!

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:12.860
POLICE

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:14.630
E-Excuse me...

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.580
Excuse me, please. Excuse m--

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:25.110
Akira, the way it's twisted...

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:27.210
- That isn't normal, is it?
- Let's go.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.380
- Is the driver dead?
- Yeah.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.320
- Where?
- Don't look at it. Come on, hurry.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:37.450
Why didn't you let me see?

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:41.370
He was twisted to death.
He looked like a wrung-out rag.

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:44.120
Let's go home!

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.330
Back home, already?

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:58.640
You said we'd go for a long ride today!

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:00.850
Out of the question!

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:05.150
Demon Alron!
This must be her doing!

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:08.320
The Demon Marshal's favorite.

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:11.630
How can I fight against her powers?

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.500
- What's that?
- A tanker trailer!

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:36.350
Alron, you little...

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.690
How can I defeat her?

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:48.360
MAKIMURA

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.720
Akira is out right now.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:52.390
Oh my, what a shame.

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:57.390
Will you please give him
this letter when he returns?

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.640
Thank you, and good day.

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:08.050
Excuse me!
Where's that letter?

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:13.290
When did she...

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:20.170
How strange, I'm positive her
hands didn't leave her pockets...

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.620
FOR MEDICINE
RECOVERY PHARMACEUTICALS

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.250
AKIRA FUDO

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:54.490
Thanks.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:56.300
Is she a friend of yours?

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:03.180
No way, I'm not interested
in older women.

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:11.720
Damn Alron, challenging
me out in the open like that!

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:23.650
Welcome back! One second,
just need to kill myself!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:25.850
Hey, cut that out!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:27.920
I said cut it out!

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:29.990
Don't interfere!

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:32.690
How are you gonna
kill yourself with this?

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:35.460
It's a paper knife!
Look, it's made of wood!

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:40.200
But, I'm afraid of real knives!
You can hurt yourself on those!

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.270
Idiot!

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:47.070
That's why I have to die!
You said so yourself, Devilman!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.520
Hey, try to keep it down.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:52.110
Akira, tea's ready!

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:53.810
I'm coming!

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:56.420
Anyway, you're not allowed to
commit suicide in my room!

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.520
How stingy!

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:04.690
What a stingy boy!

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:05.670
Huh?

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.230
AKIRA FUDO

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:10.030
Hey, it's a letter.

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:15.030
Someone besides me wrote a love
letter to Devil- I mean, to Akira.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:18.710
Well, a little peek can't hurt.

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:23.710
"At moonrise tonight..."
Wow, this is romantic!

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:25.910
"| shall wait for you at the first wharf."

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.410
Oh my goodness!

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:31.920
"| swear I will kill you"
How romantic...

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:36.520
NOT! Who wrote this?
Alron? Alron!

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:40.030
Demon Alron has challenged Devilman?

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.870
Good gracious!

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:46.370
That's it! I'll go
instead of Devilman.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:49.840
Alron will get mad and kill me!

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:55.880
I'll die in peace and be cured
of my stupidity! Perfect!

00:11:56.280 --> 00:11:57.260
Here I go!

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:01.390
Off to die, off to die...

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:08.960
I can't have you getting there first.
Sorry, Devilman!

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:14.700
Is that good?

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:24.180
I didn't mean to do anything!

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:28.440
Help!

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:29.720
No!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.890
This face is too embarrassing!

00:12:50.530 --> 00:12:54.500
Farewell, Miki. I'm not feeling
too confident about this.

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.520
Akira...

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.070
Akira, you pervert.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:03.250
Sheesh, she's talking in her sleep.

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:13.430
I'm going now, Tare.

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:23.870
Let's do this, Alron!

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:28.950
What's going on?

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:31.470
What's with this thing?

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:33.410
Hey! Wait a second!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:37.210
Hey! Stop that! Stop!
STOP! STOP!

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:38.820
Come on!

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:56.160
He's late! The moon
has already risen!

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:57.930
That Devilman!

00:13:57.930 --> 00:13:59.240
Where could he be?

00:14:02.140 --> 00:14:06.110
Well, hello there!
I've been waiting, Lil’ Alron!

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:07.970
You're Lala!

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:09.040
That's right!

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:13.510
The most beautiful demon!
I'll fight you in Devilman's place!

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:15.680
Won't this make for a cool stow?

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:17.980
Come on down! Come on!

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.790
How impudent!

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:25.740
Oh no!

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.430
You bitch!

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:34.040
Oh no!

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:47.460
Come on, Alron! I want to die!

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:54.460
Stop holding back, I'm still alive!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.740
Over here, Alron!

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.610
This time I'll really die.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:07.570
Devilman will be so happy
to see me cure my stupidity.

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:11.910
Devilman!

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.790
Sorry to keep you waiting, Alron!
Here I come!

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:28.430
DEVIL!

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:34.230
Devil Wing!

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:40.130
Alron!
Alron, where did you go?

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:42.140
Behind you! Behind you!

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.240
What?

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:44.880
Dammit!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.130
I shall tear your wings off!

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:09.330
You shall die, Devilman!

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:14.370
Devilman, what are you
doing? I'm getting impatient!

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:16.410
Do something coo--

00:16:21.840 --> 00:16:22.880
That does it!

00:16:23.380 --> 00:16:25.380
Devil Cutter!

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:30.050
That's useless!
That will not work on me!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.530
Damn!

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:34.170
Devil Chop!

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:43.740
How is this, Devilman?
Shall I break your arm?

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:52.610
It seems you cannot
use your right arm now!

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.140
Next comes your leg!

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:21.770
Devilman!
Why don't you use your Devil Beam?

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:24.200
Use the Devil B--

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:25.910
Use the Devil Beam!

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.080
Devil Beam!

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:44.190
This time, I shall tear your wings off!

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:45.670
There!

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:49.410
It may hurt, but try to bear it!

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:01.920
Alron, I've got you now!

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:05.380
- Lala, unhand me!
- No way!

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.490
Let me go!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.120
Unhand me!

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:16.920
Lala, how dare you interfere?

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:18.930
I shall crush you!

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:22.460
"Devil Beam" and make it quick!

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:24.940
All right, here I go!

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:26.580
Curses!

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:32.310
Devil Beam!

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:40.490
I did it.
Oh, that's right!

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:42.720
Hey, Lala!

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:48.220
Lala! Lala!

00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:50.460
- Where are you?
- Right here.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.470
I messed up dying again.

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:55.500
That's enough, Lala.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:56.980
Enough?

00:18:57.370 --> 00:19:00.970
You don't have to die. You
may be foolish and stupid,

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:03.480
but you're fine the way you are.

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:05.990
Don't come near me!

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:12.150
Alron messed my face up good!

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:19.150
What do you think? Are my lips too big?

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.130
Do you like creased eyelids better?

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:26.060
What an adaptable beauty I am!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.040
Heh, do what you want!

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:31.840
TEST IN PROGRESS

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:40.940
I owe my victory over Alron
to Lala's encouragement.

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:43.310
I know that. I know.

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.480
But even so...

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:48.390
This is so lame!

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:54.450
Akira, good luck on your test.

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:58.460
The third answer is "C"! Got it?

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:02.270
Would you knock it off?
You can't even help me cheat!

00:20:07.170 --> 00:20:11.400
Alron...
How difficult and tragic this was.

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:12.640
Just wait and see...

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:18.890
For your sake, I will crush
Devilman with my powers!

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:23.090
It will be too late for you
to repent, Devilman!

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:50.010
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:56.710
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.550 --> 00:21:04.370
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:10.210
Who Devilman really is

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:14.130
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:17.340
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:22.340
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:33.220
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:53.250
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:59.450
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:04.950
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:12.050
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:16.830
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:19.830
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.830 --> 00:22:26.510
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.970 --> 00:22:36.650
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:22:59.340 --> 00:23:03.580
Suddenly, time stopped in an instant.

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:05.340
In the city.
In the school.

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:06.690
People. Cars.

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:10.820
The only ones who can
move are Lala and Akira.

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:13.050
Everyone's frozen.

00:23:13.050 --> 00:23:15.860
Hey, why can't they move?

00:23:18.430 --> 00:23:21.530
From the Demon Tribe,

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:24.500
the proud Demon
Marshal Lacock appears.

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:27.970
DEVIL!

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:41.080
The battle continues. Will the
Demon Marshal win? Or Devilman?

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:43.820
One magic skill after
another is employed.

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:49.290
This is hopeless!

00:23:49.920 --> 00:23:51.700
The death match continues on and on.

00:23:57.260 --> 00:23:59.140
Devil Cutter!

00:24:04.270 --> 00:24:06.080
Suffer, Devilman!

00:24:09.280 --> 00:24:11.260
Devil Wing!

00:24:14.920 --> 00:24:16.520
What a feeling!

00:24:21.050 --> 00:24:22.430
Devil Cutter!

00:24:23.790 --> 00:24:26.240
I can kill you now, yes?

00:24:27.130 --> 00:24:30.760
Devilman has no way to attack the
constantly-changing Demon Marshal.

00:24:30.760 --> 00:24:35.100
Each form just makes her stronger

00:24:35.100 --> 00:24:37.140
as Devilman gradually weakens.

00:24:37.900 --> 00:24:39.180
Devilman is in peril!

00:24:43.110 --> 00:24:44.240
Next time on Devilman:

00:24:44.240 --> 00:24:48.060
DEMON MARSHAL LACOCK
THE FROZEN ACADEMY
